ystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.01em;text-align:center;padding:15px 32px 15px 32px;background-color:#1F1B16;color:#F5F0E6;border:1px solid #1F1B16" target="_blank"><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%;mso-text-raise:22.5" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style="max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:11.25px">See it in Accounts</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a></div><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;margin:22px 0 0 0;font-family:&#x27;Fraunces&#x27;, Georgia, &#x27;Times New Roman&#x27;, serif;font-style:italic;color:#4B463E">— Kody</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="width:100%"><tbody><tr><td class="px" style="padding:34px 40px 0"><div class="hairbg" style="height:1px;background-color:#E6DDCC;font-size:1px;line-height:1px"> </div></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="width:100%"><tbody><tr><td class="px" style="padding:22px 40px 32px"><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="width:100%"><tbody style="width:100%"><tr style="width:100%"><td align="left" data-id="__react-email-column" style="vertical-align:top"><p class="ink2" style="font-size:15px;line-height:24px;margin:0 0 5px;font-family:&#x27;Fraunces&#x27;, Georgia, &#x27;Times New Roman&#x27;, serif;color:#4B463E">Patina</p><p class="ink3" style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;margin:0;font-family:&#x27;Hanken Grotesk&#x27;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;color:#8C8578">A workshop for interior designers<br/>and the makers they trust.</p></td><